# Sarcophagus, Ship of the Dead {2}{R}: "Other creatures you control get +1/+0. Whenever a creature dies, if Sarcophagus
# isn't a creature, put a charge counter on it. Station ... 10+ | Flying". On turn 5 Targ Wrangler (a 6/3 beside it) and
# Grizzly Bears (a 3/2) station it to exactly nine charge counters: still a noncreature artifact without flying. Lightning
# Bolt kills the Bears, the Spacecraft isn't a creature, so it gets its tenth counter and becomes a 4/4 flying artifact
# creature (CR 702.184a, 603.4). The +1/+0 leaves the Wrangler's toughness alone.

